abstract: >
  FAIRe-fier is a Shiny for Python tool for validating FAIR eDNA
  metadata. It supports checking metadata structure, completeness, and
  controlled vocabulary usage to promote Findable, Accessible,
  Interoperable, and Reusable data practices.

